{
  "_doc": "The sim reel's five loops (docs/sim-reel/README.md). Each pass is one Movie Render Queue run of the game with these launch args; 'compose' joins the passes into the loop. seconds = the loop; tail = extra seconds rendered and dissolved over the head so the last frame flows into the first. start_s = game seconds before frame 0 (the gallery opens at 1 s, a capture's exposure settles by 2.5 s). dilation > 1 runs the world faster (-SailingSlowMo); keep dilation / fps <= 0.1 s per frame or the 120 Hz physics drops time (12 steps a frame). decimate keeps every n-th frame (a time-lapse past what dilation allows). Hero angles are placeholders for Ben to choose.",
  "common_args": ["-SailingReel", "-SailingCinematic=1", "-SailingNoHud", "-SailingScreenPct=100", "-SailingNoGpuSlices", "-SailingSeed=7", "-SailingDate=2026-06-20"],
